<title>UK: UK's C5 bids for Arsenal UEFA Cup deal.</title>
<headline>UK's C5 bids for Arsenal UEFA Cup deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Channel 5 is bidding for the television rights to Arsenal's home matches in European soccer's UEFA Cup competition, media industry sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Any deal would complete a European hat-trick for the new channel, which has already secured rights to televise Aston Villa's UEFA Cup matches and Chelsea home games in the Cup Winners' Cup.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8793</p>
</text>
